<%- include('partials/head', { title: '진료과목 안내' }) %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="flex-1 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-20 space-y-16">
  
  <!-- Page Header (J-Min Style) -->
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-jmin-gold tracking-widest uppercase">Clinical Programs</span>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-serif font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">연세나무 진료과목 안내</h1>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-500 font-light leading-relaxed">
      과학적인 평가와 따뜻한 마음의 치료를 융합하여, 아동·청소년의 건강한 발달과 성인의 온전한 마음 회복을 돕습니다.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- J-Min Program Cards -->
  <div class="space-y-10">
    <% subjects.forEach((sub, idx) => { %>
      <div id="<%= sub.id %>" class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xs hover:border-slate-300 transition flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
        
        <!-- Left Column -->
        <div class="w-full lg:w-72 shrink-0 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl font-bold">
            <%= sub.icon || '🌱' %>
          </div>
          <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-700">
            <%= sub.category %>
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900"><%= sub.title %></h2>
          
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-1">
            <% (sub.tags || []).forEach(t => { %>
              <span class="text-[11px] font-medium bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 border border-slate-200 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded">
                #<%= t %>
              </span>
            <% }) %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column (Symptoms & Process) -->
        <div class="flex-1 space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-jmin-gold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">클리닉 개요 및 증상</h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-light">
              <%= sub.desc %>
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Step Process (J-Min Style) -->
          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 space-y-3">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800">진료 및 단계별 치료 프로세스</h4>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-600">
              <div class="p-3.5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
                <span class="font-bold text-jmin-navy block mb-1">01. 정밀 문진 & 진단</span>
                전문의 1:1 심층 면담 및 증상 평가
              </div>
              <div class="p-3.5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
                <span class="font-bold text-jmin-navy block mb-1">02. 맞춤 치료 설계</span>
                약물 치료 및 언어·놀이·인지 심리치료
              </div>
              <div class="p-3.5 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
                <span class="font-bold text-jmin-navy block mb-1">03. 가족 코칭 & 지속 관리</span>
                양육 상담 및 정기적 호전도 모니터링
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
            하남미사 클리닉 &bull; 세종 클리닉 진료
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    <% }) %>
  </div>

</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
